def govern_asset(creative_draft, evidence_graph):
    # 1. Do not use an LLM to evaluate whole-asset vibes; extract strictly factual and legal propositions
    atomic_claims = extract_atomic_assertions(creative_draft)

    # 2. Deterministic entailment: verify claims against pre-cleared proof bundles, not raw internet/vector search
    unsubstantiated = [c for c in atomic_claims if not verify_entailment(c, evidence_graph)]

    # 3. Triage by liability: novel performance/regulated claims must route to human MLR review
    if contains_high_risk_intent(unsubstantiated):
        # Send human reviewers only the isolated delta and candidate citation, not the full copy
        return queue_for_human_delta_review(unsubstantiated, creative_draft)

    # 4. Ad networks strip C2PA headers; compliance requires hardcoded visible burn-ins
    compliant_asset = enforce_visible_disclosure(creative_draft, jurisdiction_rules)

    # 5. Continuous calibration: penalize the generator when downstream audits catch false-positive passes
    return publish_with_audit_trail(compliant_asset)

Claims come pre-approved;
the model may only bind,
not conjure the proof.

Sleep, little draft, by an evidence light;
Each claim needs a source and its license in sight.

Route health, wealth, and brand through a risk-tiered gate;
Let rules catch the known, while reviewers arbitrate.

Keep proof in a ledger when metadata won’t stay;
Re-label at serving, then audit each day.

Test misses and drift; keep the volume below—
For meaning needs judgment, and no checker yet knows.
